error[SC0153]: Science has no comprehensions; write the chain
  --> tests/ui/parse/array_comprehension.science:21:19
   |
21 |     let scaled be [x * 2 for x in xs if x > 0]
   |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this bracket holds a comprehension, not a list
